      "id": "hook",
      "text": "Can they tell you're nervous?",
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 1.308,
      "pauses": []
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "text": "Psychologists call that worry the illusion of transparency.",
      "start": 1.7,
      "end": 5.057,
      "pauses": []
    },
    {
      "id": "study",
      "text": "After class speeches, students scored their own nerves and guessed what the audience saw.",
      "start": 5.35,
      "end": 10.11,
      "pauses": [
        [
          6.475,
          6.81
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "result",
      "text": "They expected the audience to see nearly all of it. Audiences rated them clearly calmer.",
      "start": 10.75,
      "end": 15.834,
      "pauses": [
        [
          11.221,
          11.3
        ],
        [
          13.234,
